{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Information</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dicey Tales</strong> is a <strong>deck-building roguelike RPG inspired by board games</strong>.<br>Roll the dice to attack enemies and predict their moves.<br>Recruit allies as you progress and shape your own adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice + Tactics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f030b1ae2d82d6198a51bec841faadd6.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f030b1ae2d82d6198a51bec841faadd6.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f030b1ae2d82d6198a51bec841faadd6.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Battles take place on a <strong>7\u00d77 grid</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dice to move your heroes and attack enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/e638886e598be674f232cf03916db62b.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/e638886e598be674f232cf03916db62b.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/e638886e598be674f232cf03916db62b.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dice values to unleash powerful skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/8598d4e6242b4ca19c7a405c8f6675f3.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/8598d4e6242b4ca19c7a405c8f6675f3.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/8598d4e6242b4ca19c7a405c8f6675f3.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, a crisis can turn into an opportunity\u2014use enemy attacks strategically to gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Unique Heroes &amp; Skill Combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/0c9f3de8967a0400b02ad5e3b5563a3e.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/0c9f3de8967a0400b02ad5e3b5563a3e.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/0c9f3de8967a0400b02ad5e3b5563a3e.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and develop <strong>18 unique heroes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/1351fece207038ab367126b40b0f1ea1.avif?t=1770985666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras_big/1351fece207038ab367126b40b0f1ea1.avif?t=1770985666 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero follows a different skill path and plays a unique role in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leverage their distinctive abilities to make every battle dynamic and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more heroes you gather, the stronger their synergy becomes\u2014push enemies back, burn them, or freeze them in place!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World &amp; Events</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f4e8e8a9333a363913c0130371047fa2.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f4e8e8a9333a363913c0130371047fa2.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/f4e8e8a9333a363913c0130371047fa2.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey filled with countless stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From heroes to townsfolk, and even a mischievous little imp\u2014everyone has a tale to tell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/3b58d3f8b2b34fc839a7a573a18dc6de.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/3b58d3f8b2b34fc839a7a573a18dc6de.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/3b58d3f8b2b34fc839a7a573a18dc6de.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their stories, recruit them, and expand your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/a4fdf4d0170c9d8a7ca453cea7923ed8.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/a4fdf4d0170c9d8a7ca453cea7923ed8.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/a4fdf4d0170c9d8a7ca453cea7923ed8.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll the dice and shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/c515486380826b97aceacf57fbdc1fff.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/c515486380826b97aceacf57fbdc1fff.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/c515486380826b97aceacf57fbdc1fff.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out Goddess Statues to receive blessings and enhance your dice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/b9786219df41e8350cef8114bc9c39f6.poster.avif?t=1770985666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/b9786219df41e8350cef8114bc9c39f6.webm?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/b9786219df41e8350cef8114bc9c39f6.mp4?t=1770985666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics with unique effects help define your combat strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect relics to maximize your heroes\u2019 potential and discover new ways to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Chronicle</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras/4c6db2b4f34b42aed84175ae0322e993.avif?t=1770985666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/extras_big/4c6db2b4f34b42aed84175ae0322e993.avif?t=1770985666 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain experience as you play and strengthen the Heroic Chronicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empower your team and unlock new starting heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rampage in the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/1c8d729e84ee3f19c7a147c47eeceb8bc2cba320.jpg"},{"name":"Horror of the Deep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/5178b711ccf88c1c0951bc6bea927ad755e31aaa.jpg"},{"name":"Origin of Darkness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/0ab954e20e5e470f30079d7e2e2f1d1ae2892d5f.jpg"},{"name":"The First Possibility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/ad1a96f995e92926b0b4390bfde3a5b34049f59a.jpg"},{"name":"Last Ally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/ff48159be1ca5d0847ff1296dd90efa9e2b9ada3.jpg"},{"name":"Parting Time","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/e00a5d5684b7aea752d623834bd6d08ef8d71c64.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning of a Great Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/8e1a986ada4a4a1be444e71d387b737d0a66b1b3.jpg"},{"name":"Warrior's Will","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/04ae577aff8399c50928f7a933a2ad57322bc4cf.jpg"},{"name":"Wolf's Call","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/dd3c1e9690809136180d802b3689d2b565ef8d22.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3279980/84b9d15e425ee889b07dbc291c09e10fda8af965.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279980?t=1770985666","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3279980?t=1770985666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/a51ad2900c1017dba5d6b49103c46c974d1b2ab8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770985666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3279980/a51ad2900c1017dba5d6b49103c46c974d1b2ab8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770985666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descri